  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Moon Dregs — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>Your technique forms a poison unique to you and comes with your own shikigami to help manifest it.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you can use your action to summon a Jellyfish shikigami, which lasts for 8 hours and uses your proficiency bonus. You can spend 1 additional cursed energy to change the shikigami’s size between tiny and large as an action. <em>Moon Dregs</em> only takes the dodge action unless you command <em>Moon Dregs</em> using your bonus action each turn. You can summon <em>Moon Dregs</em> for free once per long rest and again for 5 cursed energy. When <em>Moon Dregs</em> is destroyed, it cannot be summoned again for 1 minute.</p>",
